==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*(s)teg- (pole)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|thikke|}}, from {{inh|en|ang|þicce||thick, dense}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*þikkwī}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*þekuz||thick}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*tégus||thick}}.

{{rel-top|Cognates}}
Cognate with {{cog|da|tyk||thick}}, {{cog|nl|dik||thick}}, {{cog|fo|tjúkkur||thick}}, {{cog|de|dick||thick}}, {{cog|is|þykkur||thick}}, {{cog|nb|tykk||thick}}, {{cog|nn|tjukk||thick}}, {{cog|stq|tjuk||thick}}, {{cog|sv|tjock||thick}}. Related to {{cog|sga|tiug||thick}} and {{cog|cy|tew||thick}}. {{rel-bottom}}

